# GoatCounter visitor analytics (https://www.goatcounter.com)
#
# Copy this file to ".env.local" in the project root if you want to
# override the defaults. ".env.local" is matched by *.local in
# .gitignore and will never be committed. Restart the dev server /
# rebuild after changing it.
#
# No API token is needed: the footer reads the visitor total from the
# public counter endpoint, which works as long as "Allow adding visitor
# counts on your website" is enabled in your GoatCounter site settings.

# Your GoatCounter site code: https://<SITE_CODE>.goatcounter.com
# (optional — the app falls back to its built-in default when unset)
VITE_GOATCOUNTER_SITE=
